<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>In Loving Memory of Ida Octavo Wyatt Myers | Cemetery Revival NC</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="A digital memorial example for NFC and QR code services offered by Cemetery Revival NC.">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&family=Work+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root{
      --cream:#f0ebdf;
      --light:#f8f4e9;
      --green:#21442f;
      --deep:#10281b;
      --gold:#c79b45;
      --sage:#dfe6d2;
      --text:#20352a;
      --muted:#526057;
      --line:#d5d0c2;
      --serif:"Fraunces",Georgia,serif;
      --sans:"Work Sans",Arial,sans-serif;
      --max:900px;
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
    body{
      margin:0;
      background:var(--cream);
      color:var(--text);
      font-family:var(--sans);
      line-height:1.4;
    }
    a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}
    .wrap{
      width:min(var(--max),calc(100% - 40px));
      margin:30px auto 26px;
    }
    header{
      background:var(--light);
      border-bottom:1px solid rgba(32,53,42,.15);
      padding:10px 0;
    }
    .header-inner{
      width:min(var(--max),calc(100% - 40px));
      margin:auto;
      display:flex;
      justify-content:space-between;
      align-items:center;
      gap:16px;
    }
    .brand{
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:8px;
      font-family:var(--serif);
      font-weight:600;
      font-size:.85rem;
      color:var(--green);
    }
    .brand img{
      width:34px;
      height:34px;
      object-fit:contain;
    }
    .tagline{
      font-size:.7rem;
      color:var(--muted);
      font-family:var(--serif);
      font-style:italic;
      text-align:right;
    }
    h1,h2,h3{
      font-family:var(--serif);
      margin:0;
    }
    .kicker{
      margin:0 0 6px;
      text-transform:uppercase;
      letter-spacing:.12em;
      font-size:.7rem;
      font-weight:700;
      color:var(--green);
    }
    .hero{
      background:var(--deep);
      color:#fff;
      border-radius:8px;
      padding:20px 18px 18px;
      position:relative;
      overflow:hidden;
    }
    .hero::before{
      content:"";
      position:absolute;
      inset:0;
      background:radial-gradient(circle at 15% 0%,rgba(255,255,255,.08),transparent 55%);
      opacity:.9;
      pointer-events:none;
    }
    .hero-inner{
      position:relative;
      z-index:1;
    }
    .hero h1{
      font-size:1.7rem;
      line-height:1.05;
      margin-bottom:4px;
    }
    .dates{
      font-family:var(--serif);
      font-size:.9rem;
      color:#f3e9d0;
      margin-bottom:4px;
    }
    .epitaph{
      font-family:var(--serif);
      font-style:italic;
      font-size:.8rem;
      color:#e7ddc7;
    }
    .section{
      background:var(--light);
      border-radius:8px;
      padding:16px 18px 15px;
      margin-top:16px;
      border:1px solid rgba(32,53,42,.08);
    }
    .section h2{
      font-size:1.1rem;
      margin-bottom:6px;
    }
    .section p{
      margin:0 0 8px;
      font-size:.8rem;
      font-family:var(--serif);
      color:var(--text);
    }
    .section p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
    .gallery{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(140px,1fr));
      gap:10px;
      margin-top:8px;
    }
    .photo-card{
      background:var(--sage);
      border-radius:6px;
      padding:8px;
      font-size:.75rem;
      font-family:var(--serif);
      color:var(--text);
      text-align:center;
      border:1px solid rgba(32,53,42,.12);
    }
    .photo-card span{
      display:block;
      font-weight:600;
      margin-bottom:3px;
    }
    blockquote{
      margin:8px 0;
      padding:8px 10px;
      border-left:3px solid var(--gold);
      background:#f5f1e6;
      font-size:.78rem;
      font-family:var(--serif);
      color:var(--text);
    }
    blockquote footer{
      margin-top:4px;
      font-size:.7rem;
      color:var(--muted);
    }
    .hymn{
      font-size:.78rem;
      font-family:var(--serif);
      margin-top:6px;
      color:var(--text);
    }
    .location{
      font-size:.8rem;
      font-family:var(--serif);
      color:var(--text);
    }
    .location strong{
      display:block;
      margin-bottom:2px;
    }
    .meta{
      font-size:.72rem;
      font-family:var(--sans);
      color:var(--muted);
      margin-top:10px;
    }
    .meta a{color:var(--green);text-decoration:underline}
    footer{
      background:#10251a;
      color:#d5ddd5;
      padding:12px 0;
      font-size:.65rem;
    }
    .footer-inner{
      width:min(var(--max),calc(100% - 40px));
      margin:auto;
      display:flex;
      justify-content:space-between;
      align-items:center;
      gap:16px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
    }
    .footer-inner span{
      font-family:var(--serif);
    }
    @media(max-width:640px){
      .wrap,.header-inner,.footer-inner{
        width:calc(100% - 26px);
      }
      .hero h1{font-size:1.5rem}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="header-inner">
    <div class="brand">
      <img src="../assets/logo.png" alt="Cemetery Revival NC">
      <span>CEMETERY REVIVAL NC</span>
    </div>
    <div class="tagline">Digital Memorial Example · NFC / QR Linked</div>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-inner">
        <p class="kicker">In Loving Memory</p>
        <h1>Ida Octavo Wyatt Myers</h1>
        <div class="dates">August&nbsp;3,&nbsp;1881 &mdash; December&nbsp;14,&nbsp;1963</div>
        <div class="epitaph">“Gone Home”</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>About Ida</h2>
      <p>Ida was known for her kindness, her love of gardening, and her devotion to family. She spent her life in the foothills of North Carolina, tending flowers and sharing stories that still make her grandchildren smile today.</p>
      <p>She believed that caring for the earth and caring for one another were deeply connected, and she lived that belief in the way she welcomed neighbors, raised her children, and kept her home filled with warmth.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Photo Gallery</h2>
      <p>Family can upload photos here to remember Ida’s life and legacy.</p>
      <div class="gallery">
        <div class="photo-card">
          <span>In the Garden</span>
          Ida standing among her flowers, early 1950s.
        </div>
        <div class="photo-card">
          <span>Family Reunion</span>
          A summer gathering at the old homestead.
        </div>
        <div class="photo-card">
          <span>Favorite Rose Bush</span>
          The rose she tended year after year.
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Favorite Hymn</h2>
      <p class="hymn">
        “Amazing Grace, how sweet the sound<br>
        That saved a wretch like me.<br>
        I once was lost, but now am found,<br>
        Was blind, but now I see.”
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Family Reflections</h2>

      <blockquote>
        “Grandma taught us that caring for the earth and for each other are the same thing.”
        <footer>&mdash; The Myers Family</footer>
      </blockquote>

      <blockquote>
        “Her laughter could fill a room, and her patience could calm a storm.”
        <footer>&mdash; A neighbor’s memory</footer>
      </blockquote>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Memorial Location</h2>
      <p class="location">
        <strong>Myers Family Cemetery</strong>
        Surry County, North Carolina
      </p>
      <p class="meta">
        This example memorial shows what a family-created tribute could look like when linked from an NFC tag or QR code placed at a loved one’s headstone.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Digital Tribute</h2>
      <p>This memorial page is a demonstration created by Cemetery Revival NC to show how an NFC tag or QR code can connect visitors directly to a loved one’s story.</p>
      <p>When a tag is scanned at the grave, family and friends can return here anytime to remember, reflect, and share new memories.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</main>

<footer>
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <div>© 2026 Cemetery Revival NC. All rights reserved.</div>
    <div><span>Cleaning · Preserving · Honoring</span></div>
  </div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
